# Dashboard Table UI Standard

Reference: `app/(dashboard)/dashboard/application/_components/applications-list-table.tsx`

All dashboard data tables MUST follow this structure and styling.

## Wrapper

- Wrap in `<BluryCard isCentered={false} blurAmount="backdrop-blur-lg" blendColorClass="bg-white/10" childClass="p-0!" className="rounded-lg p-0" />`
- Loading/error states use the same `BluryCard` with centered content (`Loader2` / `ErrorView` + retry)
- Inner scroll: `<div className="overflow-x-auto rounded-xl">`

## Table structure

Use ShadCN: `Table`, `TableHeader`, `TableBody`, `TableFooter`, `TableRow`, `TableHead`, `TableCell`.

- Footer MUST be inside `<TableFooter>` (not a separate div below the table)
- Track `columnCount` for empty-state and footer `colSpan`
- Table: `className="w-full text-left border-collapse min-w-[900px]"`

## Header

```tsx
<TableHeader className="sticky top-0 z-10">
  <TableRow className="border-b-2 border-brand-secondary/20 bg-brand-secondary/10 hover:bg-brand-secondary/10">
    <TableHead className="px-6 py-4 text-[10px] font-extrabold tracking-widest text-brand-blue-text uppercase">
      Column
    </TableHead>
  </TableRow>
</TableHeader>
```

## Body

```tsx
<TableBody className="bg-white/45">
  <TableRow className={cn(
    "border-b border-brand-secondary/15 transition-colors",
    index % 2 === 0 ? "bg-white/70" : "bg-white/45",
    "hover:bg-brand-secondary/5"
  )}>
    <TableCell className="px-6 py-5 whitespace-nowrap">...</TableCell>
  </TableRow>
</TableBody>
```

## Footer

```tsx
<TableFooter className="border-t-2 border-brand-secondary/20 bg-brand-secondary/10 hover:bg-brand-secondary/10">
  <TableRow className="hover:bg-brand-secondary/10 border-0">
    <TableCell colSpan={columnCount} className="px-8 py-5">
      {/* Showing X entries + pagination buttons */}
    </TableCell>
  </TableRow>
</TableFooter>
```

## Cell content rules

- All text via `<Typography />` — never raw `h1`/`p`/`span` for display text
- Status column: `<StatusBadge status={...} />`
- Stacked primary + secondary (e.g. Program): bold title + `text-[11px] text-gray-500 font-light` subtitle
- Action column: outline `Button` with `h-9 px-6 bg-white/20 border-white/40 ... rounded-lg font-bold text-[12px]`
- Use `React.memo` for table components

## Do not

- Put footer outside the `<Table>`
- Use flat `bg-white/30` header with no body striping
- Skip loading/error empty states inside `BluryCard`
